# Cost Attribution And Quotas

- Expensive features must be reasoned about per tenant, not just globally.
- Preserve or add attribution signals for storage, compute, API, analytics, and background-job costs.
- Use tenant-aware rate limits, quotas, or safeguards when a feature can create runaway cost.
- Do not introduce high-cost workflows without clear ownership, alerting, or observability.
- Cost control in this repo is part of product operations, not an afterthought.
